data: {"id": "c672ecc76a444572-thinking-parallel_evidence-1028", "run_id": "c672ecc76a444572", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "首轮 Kubernetes 事实已采集完毕，证据链清晰。\n\n### 1. 实体身份与生命周期\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-v10/workload`\n- **UID**: `d3e0dc86-6f8b-4f29-a50c-826bf2a1f1e6`\n- **节点**: `node2`\n- **容器**: `app` (Image: `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`)\n\n### 2. 异常状态确认\n- **当前状态**: `CrashLoopBackOff` (14次重启)。\n- **事件日志**: 持续报 `Back-off restarting failed container app`。\n- **就绪状态**: `ContainersNotReady`，因为主进程反复退出。\n\n### 3. 根因事实：应用主进程启动后立即退出\n- **直接原因**: 容器 `app` 的启动命令（Command）中硬编码了一个检查逻辑：`value = os.getenv('APP_REQUIRED_CONF", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789142977798, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

